        <mxCell id="step-1-desc" parent="step-1-legend" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=14;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Authenticated request&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;A team calls the OpenAI-compatible endpoint with its virtual key. LiteLLM validates the key and identifies the team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
